abindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"174\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a basis, the following properties must hold:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"175\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a maximally linearly independent set of vectors in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"176\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"177\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> spans <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"178\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With that in mind, let's examine our statements.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Statement I is false since the vector <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"179\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7D1 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">3</mn></msub></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> can't be written as a linear combination of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"180\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CF TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CF TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7D0 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>\u2212</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">2</mn></msub></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">}</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> But then\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"181\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 12.696em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7D1 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em;\"><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0.3em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.6em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">3</mn></msub></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>\u2212</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhich would mean that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"182\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is linearly dependent. This would contradict the fact that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"183\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a basis.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement II is true. Since <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"184\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a basis of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"185\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> it is a maximally linearly independent set of vectors. This means that if we add any new vector to the set, it becomes linearly dependent.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is true. Indeed, if <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"186\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7B TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CF TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7D0 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-texatom><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-sop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c7D TEX-S1\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">{</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">}</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is linearly dependent then there exist <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"187\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"188\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> such that \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"189\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhere at least one of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"190\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>'s is not zero. But then \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"191\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D7CE TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">b</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nwhich would mean that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"192\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is linearly dependent. This would contradict the fact that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"193\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c42 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">B</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a basis.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
